      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are some test cases to help you achieve high granular coverage:\n\n**Feature 1: Real-time IP Blacklisting via API Updates**\n\n1. Test API endpoint for replicating new blacklist entries (POST method)\n2. Test API endpoint for verifying blacklist entry existence (GET method)\n3. Test API endpoint for updating blacklist entry status (PUT method)\n4. Test API endpoint for deleting blacklist entries (DELETE method)\n5. Test API response for successful new blacklist entry replication\n6. Test API response for successful blacklist entry existence verification\n7. Test API response for successful updated blacklist entry status\n8. Test API response for successful blacklist entry deletion\n9. Test API response for invalid or missing input parameters\n\n**Feature 2: Protocol Inspection**\n\n1. Test for detecting TCP ENormally Closed (FINWait) state\n2. Test for detecting TCP RST in response to SYN packet\n3. Test for detecting UDP packet zero-checked fields\n4. Test for detecting Nmap-style port scan activities\n5. Test for detecting possible Fragment attacks\n6. Test for forwarding connections from forward port techniques\n\n**Feature 3: Auto-Scaling Rule Adjustments**\n\n1. Test automatic rule scaling on idle condition\n2. Test automatic rule",
      "source": "target",
